    "description": "The MSN app keeps you informed, productive, and entertained with tailored content, Copilot, real-time weather, stock tracking, short videos and more.\u200b\r\n\u200b\r\nKey features\u200b\r\n\r\nYour tailored feed, with you on the go.\r\nQuality content from thousands of trusted publishers.\u200b\u200b\r\n\r\nFinancial news\u200b hub\u200b\r\nSee the latest on the market, trends and your favorite stocks. \u200b\r\n\r\nYour personalized video feed\u200b\u200b\r\nScroll short clips of the latest news, trending stories and viral moments. \u200b\r\n\r\nWeather report\u200b\r\nGet hourly and 10-day forecasts, air quality, UV index and more.\u200b",
